#: ../../inox2d/about.rst:3 09920dbe11ca47da9670e1885deae28e
msgid "About Inox2D"
msgstr "關於 Inox2D"

#: ../../inox2d/about.rst:5 e6e6f776dfc445e0bc5ce83c0518c96f
msgid ""
"Inox2D is the official Rust implementation of Inochi2D, meant to ease "
"the usage of Inochi2D in Rust applications as well as webassembly "
"workloads."
msgstr ""
"Inox2D 為官方推出的 Rust 實作版本，讓開發者可以更輕鬆的在 Rust 及 "
"Webassembly 環境中整合 Inochi2D。"
